OL,3,GNEWSAMidwife made 'basic' errors in
OL,4,Ababy's care - panel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA midwife involved in the care of a
OL,7,Fmother whose baby died 27 minutes after
OL,8,Fshe was born has been given a 12-month
OL,9,Fsuspension order.
OL,11,FFiona Winser-Ramm and Dan Ramm's
OL,12,Fdaughter, Aliona, died at Leeds General
OL,13,FInfirmary (LGI) on 1 January 2020.
OL,15,FAn inquest in 2023 concluded there were
OL,16,F"a number of gross failures of the most
OL,17,Fbasic nature that directly contributed
OL,18,Fto Aliona's death", with a coroner
OL,19,Ffinding there was "neglect" in her care
OL,20,Ffrom midwives.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
