OL,3,GNEWSAMidwife made 'basic' errors in
OL,4,Ababy's care - panel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fitness to practise hearing held by
OL,7,Fthe The Nursing and Midwifery Council
OL,8,F(NMC) this week concluded midwife
OL,9,FYvette Veronica Lake's actions fell
OL,10,F"significantly short of standards
OL,11,Fexpected".
